  "details": "Launch the application/system.\n\nAttempt to move or click using the mouse.\n\nObserve that the pointer either does not move, moves unpredictably, or fails to register clicks.\n\nExpected Result:\n\nThe mouse pointer should move smoothly and accurately reflect all user inputs (movement and clicks).\n\nActual Result:\n\nThe pointer behaves inconsistently—sometimes not moving, freezing, or failing to respond to clicks.\n\nFrequency:\n\nIntermittent (occurs multiple times during normal use).\n\nEnvironment:\n\nOS: [e.g., Windows 11\n\nApplication Version: Up to Date\n\nHardware: Logitech M720 Mouse, Bluetooth connection]",
